# Template for the dotfiles-sync host list.
#
# The REAL list is NOT tracked in git (so the set of machines is never
# published to GitHub). It lives at exactly one path:
#
#   ~/.config/dotfiles/hosts
#
# Format: one host (ssh alias) per line.
#   host        -> enabled
#   #host       -> disabled (kept for later, skipped by sync)
#
# Toggle without editing by hand:
#   dotfiles-sync on  <host>
#   dotfiles-sync off <host>
#   dotfiles-sync list
#
# Example:
kali-vm-1
#my-vps.example.com
